      "side": 1,
      "message": "In details, the `#include \u003ctrace.h\u003e` is the current way of doing things before this change. So, I\u0027ll just abandon this change so that for pKVM modules, they can use `#include \u003ctrace.h\u003e` to refer to this nvhe/trace.h file.",
